<!--
  ImpliedQuantity is suppressed deliberately, not silenced. These plurals are
  bare nouns ("день" / "дня" / "дней") because the number itself is rendered
  as a separate hero Text next to them (HeroStat), not interpolated into the
  string. Lint cannot see that split and asks for a %d that would print the
  number twice.
-->
